# Product sources of truth

Read before product / UI / bot / API / tests / demo. Do not invent extra flows or message fields.

- Scenarios: `docs/user-scenarios.md` (six flows)
- Message contract: `docs/message-contract.md`
- API spec: `docs/openapi.yaml` (validated; change it together with code)

`parentMessageId` is explicit (Obsidian-style): no selection → root; reply / comment → selected message. Same canvas only. No cycles.
